<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harmony issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Harmony issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harmony Gold Mining Company Limited cautioned on Friday that it was involved in talks with Consolidated Modderfontein Mines Ltd over a proposed offer to Cons Modder shareholders.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
